*1 [[Misa Ono & Doge]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Saki Matsuga & Doge]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

